Malis loves big numbers. There are twenty-one children in her class. Her school bus has got thirty-five seats. Her book has got forty-two pages. Grandpa is seventy-three, and Great-grandmother is ninety-nine! Malis counts fifty-five stars, sixty-eight shells and eighty-six marbles.

